@startuml C3_Missing_Plans_Process_View
title C3 – Missing Operation Plans (Process Flow)

skinparam ParticipantFontStyle bold
skinparam shadowing false

actor "Logistics Operator" as Operator
participant "MissingPlansComponent" as UI
participant "TodoApi Proxy" as Proxy
participant "OEM API" as OemApi
participant "MissingPlanService" as MissingSvc
participant "RegenerationJob" as RegenJob
Database "VVN DB" as VvnDb
Database "Planning DB" as PlanningDb
participant "AuditPublisher" as Audit

Operator -> UI : Request missing plans
UI -> Proxy : GET /oem/missing-plans
Proxy -> OemApi : Forward request with JWT
OemApi -> MissingSvc : ListMissingPlans()
MissingSvc -> VvnDb : Query VVNs without plan
MissingSvc --> OemApi : MissingPlanDTO[]
OemApi --> Proxy : 200 + payload
Proxy --> UI : 200 + payload

Operator -> UI : Trigger regenerate
UI -> Proxy : POST /oem/missing-plans/{vvn}/regenerate
Proxy -> OemApi : Forward regenerate command
OemApi -> RegenJob : EnqueueRegeneration
RegenJob -> PlanningDb : Generate & persist plan
RegenJob -> Audit : Publish Regenerated event
Audit -> PlanningDb : Store audit trail
Audit --> Proxy : Webhook (optional)
Proxy --> UI : 202 Accepted (with warning)

@enduml
